 s("hyndman.koehler","Another Look at Measures of Forecast Accuracy","Hyndman and Koehler","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijforecast.2006.03.001","forecast error measures have scale, zero, intermittency and comparability limitations","MASE or another measure does not decide model selection by itself."),
