 s("fildes.goodwin","Against Your Better Judgment?","Fildes and Goodwin","https://doi.org/10.1287/inte.1070.0309","written reasons, limited intervention and track-record evaluation improve adjustment governance","Organizational recommendations do not issue authority."),
 s("fva.2025","Forecast Value Added in Demand Planning","Fildes, Goodwin and De Baets","https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijforecast.2024.07.006","forecast value added evaluates successive process interventions against declared baselines","FVA is not causal proof or a universal objective."),
